# Memory facets are line-oriented JSON (one-memory-cycle B2): a JSON
# array with one canonical object per line, every entry line comma-
# terminated, closed by a constant {"end": true}] terminator line -
# valid single-document JSON for the store loader, written only by
# promote. union merge is sound for that form: parallel branches'
# appends insert before the terminator and never touch a shared line,
# and exact-claim dedupe erases any doubled line. (_patches journals
# stay pretty-printed nested JSON and get NO union rule: line-merging
# nested JSON corrupts it.)
*.memory merge=union
